# CANDID Brand Guidelines, 2026

Source of truth: `public/brand/CANDID_Brand_Guidelines_2026.pdf`

## Colors

```css
--ink: #171614;
--blue: #4D6BC1;
--crimson: #E91536;
--cream: #F5F1EC;
--white: #FFFFFF;
```

- Ink + White/Cream carry layouts
- Crimson = CANDID Solutions accent
- Blue = CandidIQ accent
- CandidPay = crimson→blue gradient accents
- **Never invent tints** (no pink, coral, lightened crimson, etc.). Only these five tokens.

## Typography

- Display / eyebrows / headlines: **Archivo** Bold / ExtraBold / Black
- Body / UI / captions: **Inter** Regular / Medium / Bold (sparingly)
- Never retype “CANDID” — use `Logo.tsx` Accent lockup (Brand Guidelines p.07). Crimson on cream; cream/white on ink. No “Solutions” / “IQ” suffix on the umbrella site header.

## Architecture

Lead with **CANDID** on the umbrella site. Use Solutions / Pay / IQ names only when speaking to that product.

## Voice

Professional, clear, simple. Confident, friendly, easy to trust. Short sentences. No filler.
